<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Housewares raises interim headline shr.</title>
<headline>Housewares raises interim headline shr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)    12.5	   vs     11.6</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   14.00	   vs     14.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   26.74	   vs     23.14</p>
<p>    Tax			  7.34	   vs     6.88</p>
<p>    Finance costs	    4.29	   vs     2.91</p>
<p>    Turnover		 190.65	   vs     145.32</p>
<p>Full name: Housewares Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the inclusion of shares issued for the acquisition of Education Investment Corp Ltd had the effect of restating the prior year's headline earnings to 11.6 from 12.5 cents.</p>
<p>It is company policy not to declare an interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
